nks again for this blog piece.&lt;BR/&gt;Rev Charles Roberts</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8722912274108216431/comments/default/9179352175605128260'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8722912274108216431/comments/default/9179352175605128260'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/beware-war-propheteers.html?showComment=1197024300000#c9179352175605128260' title=''/><author><name>Dr Charles Roberts</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/beware-war-propheteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8722912274108216431' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8722912274108216431' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 7, 2007 at 3:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-252743850357631954</id><published>2007-12-07T00:17:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-07T00:17:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Hagee is just another pan-handling gas bag.  Over ...</title><content type='html'>Hagee is just another pan-handling gas bag.  Over the years the rhetoric and the decibels have steadily risen from his foam flecked lips.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8722912274108216431/comments/default/252743850357631954'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8722912274108216431/comments/default/252743850357631954'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freed